# Untracked scratch in the developer's working tree: root-anchored, because the real files live under
# roc-frontend/ and roc-backend/. Two patterns match files that are already committed (`fix_compose.py`,
# `package-lock.json`); an ignore rule never hides a tracked file, so those two only matter if the file
# leaves the index.
